ÕNameDateOctober 4, 2024TitleUPDATE 5 ğŸ•¹Imagerbxassetid://86903206151694CodeChangesscriptğŸ•¹ GAMEMODESDescription8Gamemodes allow you to play RIVALS in exciting new ways!YThe release of this new system features 2 new gamemodes - Team Deathmatch & Free For All!rTeam Deathmatch - Compete against your enemies (and your teammates!) to see who can rack up the most eliminations!]Free For All - Compete against the entire lobby to see who can rack up the most eliminations!DYou can check these gamemodes out in the brand new Matchmaking page!âœ¨ FINISHERSVFinishers are brand new cosmetics that play a crazy effect after eliminating an enemy!]This brand new feature plays for all eliminations, not just the final elimination in a round!tYou can get yourself these brand new finishers right now from the Finisher Pack in the Shop - which only costs keys!_Bundles may also contain brand new, exclusive finishers! Head over to the Shop to check it out!ğŸ‘¾ PIXEL BUNDLE4Contains the following brand new, exclusive rewards:%Pixel Burst skin for the Burst Rifle!#Pixel Handgun skin for the Handgun!!Pixel Katana skin for the Katana!'Pixel Flashbang skin for the Flashbang!/Exclusive Pixel Coins finisher for all weapons!)Exclusive Geometric wrap for all weapons!#Exclusive EZ charm for all weapons!x8 Finisher Packs!x8 Keys!Now available in the Shop!	ğŸ”¥ SHOP<NEW Finisher Pack - Contains all of the brand new FINISHERS!9NEW Sheriff Revolver Skin - Now available in Skin Case 2!qThe Watermelon & Beach wraps have been replaced with the brand new, limited time Damascus & Black Damascus wraps!NEW Pixel Bundle!ŠALL gamepass bundles now contain brand new, exclusive, universal finishers! Previous bundle owners have received these finishers for FREE!kThe Keythe Scythe skin in the Legendary Key Bundle has been replaced with the brand new Keyper Sniper skin!FKey Bundles may now contain the brand new, exclusive Opulent finisher!bKey Bundles have swapped over their Wrap Boxes & Skin Cases to the newer Wrap Box 2 & Skin Case 2!vThe daily shop rotation has changed from displaying 4 wraps & 5 charms to displaying 3 finishers, 3 wraps, & 3 charms!ğŸ¨ COSMETICS_NEW Midas Touch Finisher - Earned from elimination contracts after you obtain the Diamond wrap!iNEW Diamond Hands Finisher - Earned from elimination contracts after you obtain the Midas Touch finisher!LNEW enriquebruv Charm - Eliminate @enriquebruv to earn this brand new charm!LThe RPKEY RPG skin now has a new equip sound, sparkles, & a shiny new trail!The Hand Gun Handgun skin has received new shooting sounds, new wrap groups, & a brand new diamond ring to help you aim better!CThe Dynamite Gun Flare Gun skin now has fire particles on the fuse!4The Hammered Copper wrap has been completely remade!,The Diamond wrap has been completely remade!€The Sensite, Nosnite, & Nekore developer wraps can now be obtained by winning with the developer, not just winning against them!ğŸ« GIFT TICKETSCGift Tickets are a brand new feature that helps protect your gifts!©If you try to gift a player and it fails for whatever reason, you will receive a one-time gift ticket that can be used to re-gift that exact product back to your friend!ÅPlayers that were previously affected by failed gift transactions *should* automatically receive free gift tickets, but it may depend on if Roblox still recognizes that your transaction is pending.ğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESHeaderAssault RifleeğŸ“ "Hitscan weapons have been dominating the meta at all ranges which has limited weapon diversity"8ğŸ”» Critical hit multiplier reduced from 1.5x â†’ 1.25xuğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 13 â†’ 3.25 when travelling from a distance of 50studs â†’ 200studsBurst RiflerğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 20 â†’ 5 when travelling from a distance of 50studs â†’ 200studsFlamethrowerbğŸ“ "We want Flamethrower to be viable in the current meta & to improve it's lackluster mobility"&ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 14 â†’ 14.5-ğŸ’ª Reach increased from 24studs â†’ 27studs)ğŸ’ª Airblast self force increased by 50%-ğŸ’ª Airblast cooldown reduced from 5s â†’ 4sGrenade LauncherjğŸ“ "We are raising the skill ceiling of the Grenade Launcher & making it less frustrating to go against"0ğŸ’ª Direct hit damage increased from 49 â†’ 100)ğŸ”» Splash damage reduced from 49 â†’ 35;ğŸ’ª Projectile hitbox increased from 0.1studs â†’ 0.5studsMiniguncğŸ“ "We want the Minigun to excel in long range combat in contrast with the other hitscan weapons"(ğŸ’ª Max ammo increased from 200 â†’ 300"ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 8 â†’ 9tğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 9 â†’ 4.5 when travelling from a distance of 100studs â†’ 200studsPaintball Gun|ğŸ“ "These changes to the Paintball Gun gives it a unique identity while remaining a good alternative to the Assault Rifle"lâ– Now only splats enemy screens on headshots, however this splat will always obscure you from their vision7ğŸ”» Critical hit multiplier reduced from 1.5x â†’ 1.0x$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 18 â†’ 20*ğŸ’ª Ammo reserve increased from 32 â†’ 48.ğŸ’ª Reload time decreased from 4.2s â†’ 3.15sRPG]ğŸ“ "We are raising the skill ceiling of the RPG & making it less frustrating to go against"0ğŸ’ª Direct hit damage increased from 70 â†’ 150)ğŸ”» Splash damage reduced from 70 â†’ 508ğŸ’ª Projectile hitbox increased from 0.1studs â†’ 1studExogun`ğŸ“ "We are raising the skill ceiling of the Exogun & making it less frustrating to go against"6ğŸ’ª Splash radius increased from 5studs â†’ 6.28studs/ğŸ’ª Direct hit damage increased from 25 â†’ 28(ğŸ”» Splash damage reduced from 25 â†’ 6}ğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” direct hit damage drops from 28 â†’ 6 when travelling from a distance of 60studs â†’ 280studs	Flare GunağŸ“ "We want the Flare Gun to have better reasons to be picked over the other secondary weapons"(ğŸ’ª Ammo reserve increased from 0 â†’ 1.ğŸ’ª Move speed increased from Normal â†’ +10%>â– Flare particles are now slightly bigger for visual clarityHandgunTğŸ“ "These changes prevent the Handgun from rivalling the power of primary weapons""ğŸ”» Damage reduced from 13 â†’ 10tğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 10 â†’ 2.5 when travelling from a distance of 50studs â†’ 125studsRevolvercğŸ“ "We're bringing back the Revolver's 3-tap headshots in exchange for less power at long ranges"-ğŸ’ª Equip time decreased from 0.9s â†’ 0.45s$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 33 â†’ 34tğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 34 â†’ 8.5 when travelling from a distance of 50studs â†’ 200studs	Slingshot|ğŸ“ "These changes to the Slingshot allow you to punish players behind cover while remaining a good alternative to the Uzi"=â– Projectile speed decreased from 300studs/s â†’ 150studs/s5â– Projectile elasticity increased from 50% â†’ 100%9ğŸ’ª Critical hit multiplier increased from 1.5x â†’ 2.0x"ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 9 â†’ 7UziPğŸ“ "These changes prevent the Uzi from rivalling the power of primary weapons" ğŸ”» Damage reduced from 9 â†’ 73ğŸ”» Spread while aiming increased from 0Â° â†’ 3Â°tğŸ”» Now has damage dropoff â€” damage drops from 7 â†’ 1.75 when travelling from a distance of 50studs â†’ 125studsFistsRğŸ“ "We're bringing the strength of the Fists up to par with other melee weapons"$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 30 â†’ 35KatanaCğŸ“ "These changes allow the Katana to keep up with fast gameplay",ğŸ’ª Deflect cooldown reduced from 8s â†’ 4s.ğŸ”» Deflect duration reduced from 1.5s â†’ 1sScytheNğŸ“ "We want to weaken the Scythe without compromising it's dynamic movement"$ğŸ”» Damage decreased from 50 â†’ 45TrowelNğŸ“ "We're allowing the Trowel to be more impactful on the offense & defense"$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 45 â†’ 50*ğŸ’ª Build cooldown reduced from 5s â†’ 4s	Flashbang^ğŸ“ "The Flashbang's off-screen blinds have always felt unfair & unintuitive to play against"-ğŸ”» Off-screen blind strength reduced by 75%7ğŸ’ª Critical hit multiplier increased from 1.5x â†’ 2x
Freeze Ray`ğŸ“ "We are empowering the Freeze Ray to do exactly what it should be doing â€” freezing people$ğŸ”» Max ammo decreased from 2 â†’ 13ğŸ’ª Frozen players can no longer use their weapons3ğŸ’ª Frozen players can no longer move their cameraMâ– Frozen players are now affected by physics â€” no more floating ice cubesGrenade<ğŸ“ "We're allowing the Grenade to be used more creatively"Tâ– Projectiles can now be exploded prematurely by shooting / dealing damage to themMedkitkğŸ“ "The Medkit has always felt unfair to play against, these changes introduce counterplay to the weapon".ğŸ”» Healing is now cancelled by taking damage1ğŸ”» Quick heal amount decreased from 37.5 â†’ 30Molotov–ğŸ“ "The critical hit multipliers for Molotov & other throwable utility weapons were made just for consistency and should not be seen as a real buff"Smoke GrenadeHğŸ“ "We want the Smoke Grenade to excel in the current fast-paced meta""ğŸ’ª Projectiles now pop on impactYğŸ’ª Now has 3 max charges on spawn, allowing you to quickly create multiple smoke cloudsaâ– Smoke clouds will now prevent you from being highlighted through the smoke when taking damageSubspace Tripmine?ğŸ“ "We're giving the Subspace Tripmine more dynamic gameplay"&ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 140 â†’ 149UğŸ’ª Now has 2 max charges on spawn, allowing you to quickly place multiple tripmines)ğŸ”» Explosion knockback decreased by 20%Auto Shoot & Aim AssistoğŸ“ "Auto Shoot & Aim Assist have been frustrating to play against â€” especially in these specific scenarios"-ğŸ”» Auto Shoot no longer works while blinded=ğŸ”» Auto Shoot no longer shoots enemies through smoke clouds-ğŸ”» Aim Assist no longer works while blinded=ğŸ”» Aim Assist no longer tracks enemies through smoke clouds)ğŸ”» Aim Assist strength decreased by 25%
ğŸ›  OTHEROBig Arena, Big Splash, Big Backrooms, & Shooting Range has been added to 1v1v1!@The Shooting Range now has a new section to test damage dropoff!6You can now stand ontop of the blimps in Construction!HThe trampoline power on the Splash and Big Splash maps has been reduced!,More tree coverage in Splash and Big Splash!rThe invisible ceiling on Big Crossroads has been lowered & a misleading gap near the map's border has been closed!cYou can now eliminate other players inside of the Shooting Range in Private Servers (they're free)!eYou can now see other duelers' chat bubbles under their profile pictures at the top inside of a duel!UImproved visual clarity for the cooldown visuals for Katana deflect & Knife backstab!DImproved visual clarity while teleporting / editing mobile controls!'Improved UI when switching camera type!!New elimination feed UI in duels!DYou can now see everyone's win streaks and level in the player list!+You can now open up to 8 lootboxes at once!¶Influencers that have their own elimination charm reward â€” You can now temporarily disable your reward from being given out in the settings page (incase players unfairly farm you)!ğŸ› BUG FIXESjFixed a bug that allowed players to slide faster than intended while aiming with weapons such as SlingshotNFixed a bug with Medkit that allowed players to heal without going on cooldownIFixed a bug with Medkit that allowed players to heal while at full health^Fixed a bug with Trowel that allowed players to create a jump pad by exploding hardened bricksPFixed a bug with Trowel that allowed players to fling themselves abnormally high@Fixed a bug that allowed players to see through Flashbang blindseFixed a bug that temporarily disabled Aim Assist while manually moving your camera using a controller™Fixed a bug where keeping your quick melee / quick utility weapon would allow you to skip the equip animation when switching back to your original weaponaFixed a bug with quick melee / quick utility where you wouldn't be able to switch weapons anymoreKFixed a bug where Auto Shoot wouldn't work on dummies in the Shooting Range`Fixed a bug with the Big Crossroads map that didn't let teams spawn inside of the green mountain‚Fixed a bug with the Big Crossroads and Shooting Range maps that made the winning team float in the air during the end game screenRFixed a bug with the Station map that allowed you to clip inside of the coal cartsIFixed a visual bug with the Hand Gun Handgun skin while aiming & shootingaFixed a visual bug when wrapping the Hand Gun Handgun skin & when wrapping the default Fists skinmFixed a visual bug that displayed critical hit multipliers in the weapons page for weapons that couldn't critZFixed a visual bug where chat bubbles would be hidden by people's win streaks in the lobbyğŸ“œ A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERScWe're making these big balance changes to get the game to a diverse & balanced state before Ranked.…Furthermore, we have no new updates for you all on Ranked as we have quite a few things on our roadmap we would like to get to first.ëFor transparency purposes â€” our current roadmap consists of releasing an exciting new Spooky update, and then a batch of new weapons & gameplay content afterwards, and then finally finish the year off with the Winter & Ranked update!␀‡7␀␀
